  {
    "id": 4001076060520,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "明るいムードメーカー、気配りが上手、\r\nまわりをよく見ている──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060530,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "代役が決まった時の反応、任せる側としての覚悟……\r\nあの責任感の強さはどこから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060530"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "01100",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1202",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060540,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "──せっかくハッキリ勝負がつくかと思ったのに\r\nこっちのチームにもアンタがいるんじゃ、無効試合ね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060540"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060550,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "あはは、確かにそれは残念……！\r\n正々堂々かなちゃんとやれるの、楽しみにしてたのになぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060550"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060560,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "は……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060560"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060570,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "でも今回は一緒に頑張ろうよ、かなちゃん！\r\n同じチームになれたんだし！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060570"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060580,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "アンタ……\r\n──それ、智代子のつもり？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060580"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060590,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060590"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060600,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "かなちゃんたちが一緒に練習してきたのは、\r\nただのヒマワリじゃなくて智代子ちゃんのヒマワリでしょ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060600"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060610,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "だったらそうならないと、\r\n代役、まっとうできないもん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060610"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060620,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060620"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060630,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "あ、そ。そんな突拍子もないことして、\r\nヘタクソだったら容赦なく出番食うわよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060630"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060640,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "え～？　困るなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060640"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00541",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060650,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "……ねぇかなちゃん、忘れちゃダメだよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060660,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "チームごとでの勝敗はつかないかもだけど、\r\n私たちがふたりともカメリアをやるのは変わらないんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060660"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060670,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "かなちゃんより私が上手いって、\r\nちゃんと結果が出ちゃうんだよ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060670"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060680,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "智代子はそんなこと言わないと思うけど？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060680"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060690,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "いけない、本音が出ちゃった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060690"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060700,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "役の落とし込みが足りないんじゃないのー？\r\nこの様子じゃ、本番も思いやられるわね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060700"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060710,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "そういうのは本番が終わってから言って\r\n──まぁ、言わせないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060710"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060720,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060720"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060730,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060730"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフたち",
    "text": "Bチームのみなさん！\r\nまもなく開演となります──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "1277"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060731,
    "speaker": "かな＆あかね",
    "text": "！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060731"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060740,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "──いくわよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060740"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060750,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060750"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001076060760,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "うん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400107606/4001076060760"
  },
